unterpoint Research最新发布的全球畅销机型榜单显示，2026年第二季度，全球手机畅销榜TOP10被苹果与三星两家厂商完全瓜分，各占据五个席位。数据显示，两家头部厂商合计贡献全球智能手机总销量的26%，该占比创下历年二季度新高，同比提升2个百分点。而同期全球智能手机市场出货量同比下滑11%，创下2013年以来同期最低水平。具体来看，榜单前三名被iPhone 17系列悉数包揽。值得一提的是，中国品牌此次完全跌出前十榜单。'}, {'id': '20260827A03HWQ00', 'articletype': '0', 'title': '全球芯片TOP 20，最新榜单', 'pic_style': 0, 'publish_time': '2026-08-27 08:42:20', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OOHP5oH9KCQqMr9dFFHLyqmM1t3aRcINFu7i3Z1PncKRkAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OOHP5oH9KCQqMr9dFFHLyqmM1t3aRcINFu7i3Z1PncKRkAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OOHP5oH9KCQqMr9dFFHLyqmM1t3aRcINFu7i3Z1PncKRkAA_197130/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '1', 'ext': {'196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OOHP5oH9KCQqMr9dFFHLyqmM1t3aRcINFu7i3Z1PncKRkAA_196130/0', '360x240': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OOHP5oH9KCQqMr9dFFHLyqmM1t3aRcINFu7i3Z1PncKRkAA_360240/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/OOHP5oH9KCQqMr9dFFHLyqmM1t3aRcINFu7i3Z1PncKRkAA_330330/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/Om3GcPs3-vfSFhRuaaguVAhdoNjlhlPDuCxsZDdRtTK2QAA_240240/0', 'img_count': 3}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260827A03HWQ00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260827A03HWQ00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260827A03HWQ00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260827A03HWQ00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '18661784', 'chl_name': '半导体行业观察', 'icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/11917916881_200200/0', 'sicon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/11917916881_200200/0', 'mrk': '最有深度的半导体新媒体，实讯、专业、原创、深度，50万半导体精英关注！专注观察全球半导体最新资讯、技术前沿、发展趋势。', 'last_art_update': '0', 'uin': 'ecf47d206fb541f06013c706c5a33c8403', 'encoded_suid': '8QMa23dZ7ocdvjc=', 'vip_type': '30013', 'vip_type_new': '30013', 'vip_desc': '半导体行业观察官方账号', 'vip_icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876049251/0', 'medal_info': {'type_id': 26, 'medal_id': 40, 'medal_level': 1, 'medal_name': '万众瞩目', 'medal_desc': '腾讯新