%，跑赢上证指数16.44个百分点。仅今日一天，其账户收益便浮盈23.28万元，目前持仓总市值接近593万元。他称自从不再“师从段永平”后的三个月里，泡泡玛特表现平平，并直言从今年5月开始，90%买泡泡玛特的人都赚不到钱。'}, {'id': '20260826A0DL5K00', 'articletype': '0', 'title': '许家印父子同日宣判，但所欠的2.4万亿该怎么办？', 'pic_style': 0, 'publish_time': '2026-08-26 22:14:10', 'pic_info': {'big_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O28qn62QqHSBCtscBUPNNWUE2DowVECzADgT7tf6C-dmEAA_870492/0'], 'small_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O28qn62QqHSBCtscBUPNNWUE2DowVECzADgT7tf6C-dmEAA_294195/0'], 'three_img': ['https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O28qn62QqHSBCtscBUPNNWUE2DowVECzADgT7tf6C-dmEAA_197130/0'], 'ls_img_exp_type': '1', 'ext': {'196x130': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O28qn62QqHSBCtscBUPNNWUE2DowVECzADgT7tf6C-dmEAA_196130/0', '360x240': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O28qn62QqHSBCtscBUPNNWUE2DowVECzADgT7tf6C-dmEAA_360240/0', '330x330': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O28qn62QqHSBCtscBUPNNWUE2DowVECzADgT7tf6C-dmEAA_330330/0'}, 'share_img': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/om_ls/O28qn62QqHSBCtscBUPNNWUE2DowVECzADgT7tf6C-dmEAA_8080/0', 'img_count': 6}, 'link_info': {'share_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260826A0DL5K00', 'url': 'https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260826A0DL5K00', 'short_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260826A0DL5K00', 'org_url': 'https://view.inews.qq.com/a/20260826A0DL5K00'}, 'media_info': {'chl_id': '20399411', 'chl_name': '大白侃财经', 'icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/13775654458_200200/0', 'sicon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/13775654458_200200/0', 'mrk': '家事国事天下事，事事关心', 'last_art_update': '0', 'encoded_suid': '8QMZ3XZV7oMasT0=', 'vip_type': '30011', 'vip_type_new': '30011', 'vip_desc': '财经领域创作者', 'vip_icon': 'http://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_ls/0/14876048581/0', 'medal_info': {'type_id': 52, 'medal_id': 80, 'medal_level': 2, 'medal_name': '连续阅读30天', 'medal_desc': '连续登录30天达成，若中断将重新累计进度', 'night_url': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_bt/0/0107171320400_3576/0', 'daytime_url': 'https://inews.gtimg.com/newsapp_bt/0/0107171320400_3576/0'}}, 'interation_info': {'comme